    "Only Delta_frac at x1 is the pre-declared contrast; the 2x2 is exploratory, without multiplicity correction",
    "the operationalization of 'beyond -0.010' and 'more negative' (entire 95% CI) was fixed in this script before reading the F2 MLP result, but was NOT written in the queue header",
